<title>USA: Sioux City hogs off $0.25 to $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs off $0.25 to $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderate. Compared with Monday, barrows and gilts closed $0.25 to $0.50 lower. Top $52.75 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     52.50-52.75</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     52.00-52.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     50.00-51.50</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     48.00-49.50</p>
<p>Sows:  all weights mostly steady to 1.00 higher on a thin test.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs     43.00</p>
<p>		 400-450 lbs     46.00</p>
<p>		 450-500 lbs     49.00</p>
<p>		 500-550 lbs     50.00</p>
<p>		 550-600 lbs     53.00</p>
<p>		 600-700 lbs     54.00</p>
<p>Boars:	 300-700 lbs     41.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
